%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4b18d3638c0d8eebe61f277ee53908b1, https://si.imgix.net/55dfb563/uploads/origins/b244e4a2-af18-4127-9e62-900296747d16?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4d15c136b77a88a07900d6d91acd2515 2x, https://si.imgix.net/55dfb563/uploads/origins/b244e4a2-af18-4127-9e62-900296747d16?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0240849b9e118bfc940f2de6d30088cb 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Twitterで見かけて素敵な絵を描く方だなと思いまして、\nよければうちの子を描いていただけないでしょうか🙏\n構図や服装などは全てお任せとさせてください！\n\nキャラクター:\nhttps://twitter.com/kaguo_v/status/1740258926548091364\nhttps://kaguo.net/contents/character", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@okome_no_su/works/12", "scraped_at": "2026-02-14T14:57:26.827357+00:00", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/a7657ca9/uploads/origins/ff9c0cea-cc9f-4e10-a77b-6852232e66e1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ee9e49040dfe556b3dcab43afca23356", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/a7657ca9/uploads/origins/ff9c0cea-cc9f-4e10-a77b-6852232e66e1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ee9e49040dfe556b3dcab43afca23356, https://si.imgix.net/a7657ca9/uploads/origins/ff9c0cea-cc9f-4e10-a77b-6852232e66e1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=704b3383fd66de01c4edab0a4936a0be 2x, https://si.imgix.net/a7657ca9/uploads/origins/ff9c0cea-cc9f-4e10-a77b-6852232e66e1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=956c8f98309fc30fa64e660bc7d64656 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello おこめさん\nI really like your work, so I was wondering if you could draw my character, his name is 「AOI」\nI would like to ask you to draw a scene where I am wearing a collar, and my owner is taking me out for a walk\n\nFursona：\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/16Zw5sDYk9_4lwKX4